{title: On Jordan's Stormy Banks}
{artist: Samuel Stennett}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 84}

Verse 1
On [D]Jordan's stormy [G]banks I [D]stand, and cast a wishful [A]eye
to [D]Canaan's fair and [G]happy [D]land, where [A]my pos[D]sessions lie.

Chorus
I am [D]bound for the promised land, [G]I am [D]bound for the promised [A]land;
O [D]who will come and [G]go with [D]me? I am [A]bound for the promised [D]land.
